  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scoping of the Zanzibar Start-up Ecosystem</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Currently, there is no clear overview of the start-up system of Zanzibar. Who are the start-ups working in Zanzibar, what are their challenges and what can be done to support them? These questions are all left unanswered at this point. The scoping of the start-up ecosystem of Zanzibar aims to fill this gap through providing a thorough mapping and analysis of the current start-up ecosystem of Zanzibar. Through interviews with start-ups and by directly engaging with local stakeholders such as knowledge institutes, government organisations, NGO&#x2019;s and other relevant stakeholders, an assessment of the current ecosystem will be delivered. In turn, a roundtable will be organized together with start-ups and stakeholders to discuss challenges, solutions and recommendations. In the end, a final presentation will be given as a sum-up of the findings, recommendations and proposed follow-ups.</narrative>
  </description>
